# SecondPass — environment variables
# Copy this file to .env and fill in values before running.
#
# The OPENAI_API_KEY is OPTIONAL.
# Without it, the pipeline still runs in full: pitch, STARS student, alignment,
# coaching cards, section trends, and the overview tile are all unaffected.
# Only the LLM-written summary text and vocal-profile generation are skipped,
# and doctor.py will note this with a [WARN] rather than a [FAIL].
#
# If you do supply a key, GPT-4o-mini is used by default (configurable in
# vocal_coach/llm.py). Standard OpenAI API pricing applies.

OPENAI_API_KEY=
